cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use scPCIP, please cite it as below."
title: "scPCIP: single-cell Plant Cell Identity Programs"
abstract: >-
  scPCIP annotates plant single-cell RNA-seq data (root, leaf, flower and seed) with cross-species gene programs.
  Each cell type is described by a weighted set of orthogroups learned from many labelled plant atlases, so a new
  dataset can be annotated without a reference atlas from the same species.
